<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Radio Ireland appoints Dick Hill as chief executiv.</title>
<headline>Radio Ireland appoints Dick Hill as chief executiv.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Radio Ireland announced that it has appointed Dick Hill as chief executive.</p>
<p>Hill was a director of RTE Television from 1980 to 1986.  </p>
<p>Prior to that Hill, who was a founding member of  Network 2, left RTE to take up an appointment as general manager of Cork Opera House Plc, Radio Ireland said in a statement. -- Dublin newsroom +353 1 676 9775</p>
</text>
